---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="SEA & PPC | Google Ads, Microsoft Ads & Campaigns | Valorferrum"
  description="SEA freelancer for Google Ads, Microsoft Ads & PPC campaigns. Data-driven optimization for maximum ROAS."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12 reveal">
        <a href="/en/services/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          All Services
        </a>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">SEA & PPC</h1>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg">Google Ads, Microsoft Ads & more. Data-driven optimization, not gut-feeling management.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Google Ads</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Search, Display, Shopping, Performance Max. Campaign structure, keyword strategy, negative lists & bid management.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:100ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Microsoft Ads</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">LinkedIn targeting, lower CPCs, B2B focus. Often underestimated, often profitable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:200ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Social Ads</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Meta, LinkedIn, Taboola, Criteo. Advertise where your audience is – not everywhere.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay:300ms">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Tracking & Reporting</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Conversion tracking, attribution, ROAS optimization. Every euro must be accountable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-spectrum-pink/10 to-spectrum-purple/10 border border-spectrum-pink/20 text-center">
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">Pricing & Process</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6">Setup from 1,290€. Monthly optimization on hourly basis or percentage share. Transparent.</p>
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all">Request Project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>